## Release: v0.1.0

Published 2026-10-05 at https://github.com/Data-Wise/apa-layout (public, MIT).
Install: `quarto add Data-Wise/apa-layout`; filter reference `Data-Wise/apa-layout`
(Quarto names the folder after the repo owner, not the in-repo `dtofighi/`).

- Five filters fix apaquarto 7.0.0 layout bugs (docx tables/lists, jou figure
  floats and notes, stranded table captions, Typst \big/\! math).
- `tests/run.sh` (7 checks) and `tests/prove-fail.sh` (negative controls).
- Workflow (craft style): feature/* -> dev (squash) -> main (release PR, merge
  commit). main protected; dev has a deletion-only ruleset.
- CI (`.github/workflows/test.yml`): `layout` job runs both test scripts on PRs and
  pushes to main/dev. Not yet a required check on main.
- Consumer: pmed vendors a byte-identical copy at `_extensions/dtofighi/apa-layout`.

## Not in scope

Manuscript-specific fixes (math macro blocks, caption-to-note splits, equation
breaks); an apaquarto fork (decision in README, "Why an add-on, not a fork").
